  {
   "id": 99818,
   "title": "Cohesion: Your public equities agentic teammate",
   "body": "[Cohesion](https://cohesionplatform.com/) is your public equities agentic teammate.\n\nCohesion agents track earnings, news, and non-traditional datasets like podcasts and X/Twitter.\n\nToday\u2019s tools require querying, endless reading, and manual search across decade-old platforms that aren\u2019t capturing the most important datasets.\n\nWe built a team of AI agents that monitor the companies you cover and generate differentiated insights. The result? Captured alpha, less time searching \u201cwhy is $stock down\u201d, automated idea generation - all in a system purpose-built for public equity investing that doesn't require manual setup.\\\n\\\n<https://youtu.be/DZMmSVwp2Pk>\n\nToday, Cohesion is live with 10+ long/short and long-only fundamental equity funds managing a combined $10Bn+ AUM. Built by a team with 10+ years of public markets investing experience.\n\nIn advance of the upcoming earnings season, we\u2019re offering limited early trial access. Take 2 minutes to send 20 tickers and have the easiest earnings season of your career:[ https://cohesionplatform.com/#start-free-trial](https://cohesionplatform.com/#start-free-trial)",
   "state": "public",
   "tagline": "A team of AI agents that monitor the companies you cover and generate differentiated insights.",
